tory":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, and it is the driest pair at 4.06 inches. In 2025 the middle got 40% of normal in August to September and 42% of normal in September to October of 2025. Grid 25079 saw its driest year in 1963, at 70% of normal.</p>"}
